# Local config: CuteAFD v4.0.0 (tag 55dc4e24), 2x RTX PRO 6000, local experts, no Sparks. K4-Core-K6 (wrldsuksgo2mars 5d3fffe1): K4 experts, native EXL3 K6 core and head. Same keys as the K4 file, so the pair differs only in checkpoint; MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS 262144 as K4 (tpurtell's card runs 1M).
# Ported from the v3.0.1 file of the same name in <cuteafd>/local (local deviations kept:
# ADDR on 127.0.0.1, USAGE=off, MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS at the engine ceiling, image pinned by digest, drafter pinned).
# Changes from v3.0.1: GLM5_FLASH_FP8_MODEL_ID removed (an unknown key on v4: hard error; v4 reads all projections
# from the primary checkpoint, which is what =off did); INSTANCE=local-v4 (state under
# ~/.cache/cuteafd/instances/local-v4, container cuteafd-coordinator-local-v4, so v3.0.1 and v4 never share
# launcher state); v4 image. Everything else is the v3.0.1 file's.
#
#   cd <stacks>/cuteafd-v4 && HF_HOME=<hf-home> ./run.sh --config local/glm53-flash-exl3-k4-core-k6-2rtx.config --dry-run
